WEBVTT

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.190
A cat.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.730
A cat?

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:17.830
Where?

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.200
There, look.

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:22.530
Doesn't that cloud look like a cat?

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:28.340
You could call it a cat... 
or maybe a dog or a raccoon.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.710
What a convenient silhouette.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:34.340
Don't you think that cloud 
looks more like a cat?

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:37.560
It's running with a fish in its mouth.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:39.390
It's all messed up.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:43.180
I bet master artist Tsukahara drew that cat.

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:48.330
The sky's so blue because it's depressed 
by Kaname's drawing skills.

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:49.570
Shut up.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.940
Class is starting.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:54.310
Hurry.

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:56.000
Wait.

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:02.720
<i>Spring.</i>

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:07.170
<i>Pink cherry blossom petals 
dance like butterflies,</i>

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>and white clouds drift 
lazily across the sky.</i>

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:15.740
<i>We're now third years 
at Homare High School.</i>

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:41.370
Even though we're third 
years, nothing has changed.

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:44.180
We changed classes.

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:50.430
Changing classes makes me feel 
like we've become third years.

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:53.100
Kaname-kun and Yuta-kun 
are in Class 4...

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:55.190
and we're in Class 3.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:58.090
Yuki-kun and Chizuru-kun,

00:02:58.090 --> 00:02:59.820
I look forward to spending 
the year with you.

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:05.740
Don't bother. You won't make it.

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:08.250
You're gonna miss, Chizuru.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:12.000
You'll miss, walk over to pick it up, 
and then drop it in the trashcan.

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:16.210
You don't even have a comeback.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.190
I'm concentrating!

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:20.220
Shut up for a second!

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:25.100
Yuki-kun, that was amazing.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.910
Why'd you have to get it in before me?

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:29.250
This sucks.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.230
Did you really have to 
put that kinda pressure on me?

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:34.430
No, I just threw it away.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:35.800
I wanted to throw it away,

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:38.480
and it just happened to 
go in when I threw it.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.870
You're putting tons of pressure on him.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:41.990
Damn it!

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:48.370
<i>Then... Then, if I make this, 
I'll run into Mary today at...</i>

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:49.190
<i>...school!</i>

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:50.720
Shun-chan.

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:51.790
She's here!

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:55.790
Huh? Oh, um... nothing.

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:58.000
Masaki-chan.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.690
Construction paper?

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.630
Are you using that to make something?

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.170
Oh, yeah.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:06.220
I have to write the brackets for 
the sports festival tournament.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:10.550
Oh, right. The sports 
festival's coming up.

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:12.850
I'm part of the Athletics Committee.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:14.230
The Athletics Committee?

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:16.230
I lost at rock, paper, scissors.

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:17.980
I see.

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:19.810
Um...

00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:24.100
Shun-chan, what event will you be 
participating in at the sports festival?

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.370
Me?

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:28.000
I'm playing volleyball.

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.580
Me too, me too!

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:33.330
We're all playing volleyball.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:37.120
I'm actually quite good at volleyball.

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:39.340
I don't think it really fits my image, though.

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:41.840
No, it totally fits you.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:47.220
I'll d-definitely come to cheer you on.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:49.930
Really?

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:51.310
I'll have to do my best, then.

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:52.430
Yeah.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.990
Oh, right.

00:04:55.990 --> 00:04:59.060
I need to go borrow some markers.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:02.190
You have more stuff to carry?

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:05.040
You should have asked someone 
in your class to help you.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.450
Can you handle it yourself?

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:09.820
No, asking for help too rashly 
could be even more dangerous.

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:12.700
She might end up getting 
carried herself.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.330
I'm not that small!

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.080
See you later.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.820
Ouch.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:23.470
With arms that strong, she can 
definitely manage it all by herself.

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:28.640
And every time, you manage to make
 Masaki angry all by yourself.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.100
What'd you say?!

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:34.060
I'm always genuinely worried about Mary, you—

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:34.060
Hey, does she have any friends in her class?

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.080
Huh?

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:37.310
Well, you know...

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:40.960
I've just never seen her with anyone.

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:45.810
Well, I guess she is always by herself.

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:47.390
That's no good.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:50.320
School's a place to learn 
how to interact with groups.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:52.480
You're one to talk.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:56.230
She probably just doesn't care too much...

00:05:56.230 --> 00:06:00.100
about whether she has friends or not.

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:03.210
Maybe, but...

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:08.080
I hope Masaki makes friends 
in her new class.

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.060
Sato-san.

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:17.280
You got the construction paper and markers?

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:18.800
I'm sorry.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:20.900
I'm on the Athletics Committee too, 
so I should have...

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:22.480
Maybe I'll play dodgeball.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.540
But there's only one space left.

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:25.990
We won't be able to play together.

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:27.990
Then, basketball maybe.

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:30.930
I'm getting everyone to decide what events...

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:33.570
they want to participate 
in at the sports festival.

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:35.520
What do you want to do, Sato-san?

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:37.330
What's left?

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:41.040
Basketball and soft tennis.

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:44.040
Also, dodgeball's got one more spot.

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:46.840
I'll play dodgeball, then.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.460
What? Really?

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:50.660
Yeah, can't I?

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:53.180
Sure you can, but...

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.990
Soft tennis would be okay, too.

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:58.230
Then, Yuko, you should pick that.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:00.070
I don't want to do it by myself.

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:02.530
I don't want to!

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:03.860
Anyway...

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.950
We're supposed to get people

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:09.110
who aren't already busy on 
festival day to be the referees.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:13.350
So, I thought we could talk with 
everyone about who'll referee—

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:14.870
What?

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.200
I-I want to write that one.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.580
Huh? Here?

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:21.820
<i>Shun-chan's class.</i>

00:07:21.820 --> 00:07:24.510
<i>Carefully, carefully...</i>

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:31.700
<i>Sato-san's always with 
Yuki-senpai and his friends,</i>

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:34.350
<i>so I figured she had lots of friends, but...</i>

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:37.460
<i>Please let Shun-chan's class win.</i>

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:40.350
<i>Let them win. Let them win.</i>

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.860
See you later.

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:42.850
Bye bye.

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:44.470
Bye bye.

00:07:56.880 --> 00:08:01.020
Why is our class the only one like this?

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:02.500
Who knows?

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.920
Because we've got flowers 
blooming in our heads?

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:08.500
I've got it! It means we're VIPs.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.800
Like, we're the favorites to win.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:14.020
I see.

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:18.500
You're not a team, 
you're a trio of idiots.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:21.060
Kaname-kun, Yuta-kun.

00:08:21.490 --> 00:08:23.940
Are you here to cheer for your class?

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:26.060
No, we're here to play.

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:28.410
We're up against you next.

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:30.180
You're kidding! Seriously?

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:35.020
This could be an easy win for us, then?

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:38.090
I don't think we're gonna lose 
to a nerd who refuses...

00:08:38.090 --> 00:08:39.950
to carry anything heavier 
than his study guides.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:42.190
Look who's talking.

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:44.790
I don't think someone as short as 
you will be blocking any of our spikes.

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:46.420
What'd you say?!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:49.800
Height doesn't decide a match.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:54.220
You've got to use this when 
you play sports. This right here.

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:56.220
Then, it'll be a crushing defeat for you.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:09:00.470
<b>Peach Yogurt</b>

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:10.430
Let the game between 
Class 3-3 and Class 3-4 begin!

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:17.240
Go get 'em, Shun-chan.

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:18.460
Okay.

00:09:21.230 --> 00:09:22.140
Whoops.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:22.700
Kaname.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:25.620
No, you don't! I'll block you!

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:28.700
Yeah, Tsukahara!

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:29.660
Yeah!

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:30.540
Stop that.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.100
Don't worry, Chizuru-kun.

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:34.720
We're just getting started.

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:35.820
That's right.

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:38.920
You're just starting to grow, Chizuru.

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:40.070
Shut up!

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:43.060
And you should chase after the ball 
like your life depends on it!

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.570
I'm doing that.

00:09:44.570 --> 00:09:46.060
You haven't moved!

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:49.470
But I'm gritting my teeth really hard.

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:51.940
You're just suppressing a yawn!

00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:56.280
Not bad at all, Kanamecchi.

00:09:56.280 --> 00:10:01.040
I guess the top student of your class
 doesn't just spend all day studying.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:02.030
How terrifying.

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:05.250
I spike a yellow ball every day...

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.170
But, it's okay.

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:09.000
Once we take out their 
big hitter, Kanamecchi,

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.550
we'll still have a good chance of winning.

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:14.810
Let's go break his glasses.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.330
Here it comes again, Yukki.

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:40.690
Hey!

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:43.490
I'll get it next time.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:45.840
Get it with your face!

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.040
Here.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.370
I'll block you!

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:53.860
Score!

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:55.300
Asaba did it!

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.330
Wh-What was that?

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:58.800
Yutan's their big hitter now?

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:08.140
Chizuru-kun.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.890
Okay, I got this...

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:15.450
Why are you running away? Get it.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:17.690
Who could get that?! It would've killed me!

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:22.130
That was dangerous, Yukki.

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:24.660
That was my time to shine.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:27.700
Okay, okay. I got it, so serve already.

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.260
All right!

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:31.310
Now that we're all up and running,

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:33.200
it's our turn to attack!

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:34.710
Prepare yourselves.

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:39.620
Yeah!

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:42.220
Game, set and match. Class 1-7 wins.

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:43.420
Sorry.

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:45.720
It just popped off your head.

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:49.260
<i>I'm not good at sports.</i>

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:50.460
<i>Oh well.</i>

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:52.920
<i>I'd better go referee 
the dodgeball game.</i>

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:54.450
Matsushita-kun!

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:57.560
Matsushita-kun! Matsushita-kun!

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:59.270
You're on the Athletics Committee, right?

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:00.360
Come here a second.

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:03.860
The soft tennis referee hasn't shown up?

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:05.320
No.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.300
Huh?

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:10.140
Adachi-san from our class 
was supposed to do it...

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:12.370
Dacchin said she had to go early.

00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:13.850
What?

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:16.750
Can someone take Adachi-san's place?

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:19.280
Yeah, I'll do it.

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:21.660
Yuko, come with me.

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:23.880
Wait for me until I'm finished refereeing.

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:28.260
What? But I have to go cheer 
for some upperclassmen.

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:30.620
Yocchi, can't you do it?

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:32.580
I can, but...

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:34.770
Noriko, will you wait until I'm done?

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:37.920
I wonder how long it will take...

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:40.090
<i>Anyone will do, just hurry.</i>

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:41.120
Aren't you ready yet?

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:42.880
I-I'm sorry.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:48.820
Sato-san! Sato-san!

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:50.410
What?

00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:53.520
The soft tennis referee hasn't turned up.

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:55.420
Can you do it, Sato-san?

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:57.040
Yeah, sure.

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.220
Huh? Really?

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:00.800
You decided that quickly.

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:05.330
Yeah, we already lost our 
dodgeball game, anyway.

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:07.680
The games are on the tennis 
courts outside, right?

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:17.020
Sato-san! Sato-san! Take this.

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:19.660
It's the game record sheet—

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:31.060
<i>Sitting there tall and dignified all by herself,</i>

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:33.420
<i>Sato-san seemed a little bigger...</i>

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:36.280
<i>and a little cooler that day.</i>

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:50.850
<b>Milk</b>

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:55.350
Game, set and match. 
Class 3-3 wins, three games to two.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.880
Yes, yes, yes!

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:01.140
We're going to the finals!

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:02.070
You're kidding...

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:12.440
Class 3-3's volleyball game?

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:13.330
Yeah.

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:16.220
It was at the same time 
as our dodgeball game,

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:17.830
so I haven't seen them play yet.

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:21.170
I heard they still have the 
final game left to play.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:23.460
I really want to go see it.

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:27.260
Do you know someone who's playing?

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:31.720
S-Someone I'm sort of... friends with.

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:33.990
A friend?

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:34.840
Yeah.

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:38.550
<i>I wonder who it could be in Class 3-3...</i>

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:43.480
<i>Maybe Yuki-senpai is playing, too?</i>

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:48.850
I want to go see that game, too...

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:52.270
Oh, I mean, an upperclassman from my club is...

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:54.580
An upperclassman from 
the Manga Club might be playing,

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:58.820
so I just... I just figured 
I should go cheer him on.

00:14:58.820 --> 00:15:00.400
I promise I didn't mean anything else.

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:01.500
Why don't you go watch?

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:07.080
Let's finish this so 
we can go watch the game.

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:14.850
Do you think they jump 
really high when they attack?

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.440
Of course they jump!

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:19.370
Way higher than either of 
us can reach, like this!

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:22.510
They jump this high!

00:15:22.510 --> 00:15:23.270
You're right.

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:26.430
Maybe like this.

00:15:26.430 --> 00:15:28.240
No, higher.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:30.130
Maybe this high.

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:31.580
Higher, higher.

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:33.910
This high!

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:38.830
Wipe it off! Wipe it off!

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:38.830
Tissues, tissues, tissues, tissues...

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.710
<b>Award</b>

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:43.760
<i>Wh-What are we going to do?</i>

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:48.530
More and more schools have stopped...

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:50.840
assigning ranks at their sports events.

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:53.910
What? Where did that come from?

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:55.850
We can't do that!

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:58.050
We have to hand out awards!

00:15:58.050 --> 00:15:59.270
But...

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.970
But they're soaking wet.

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:04.520
Let's just get them dried off. It'll be okay.

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:07.280
The volleyball game's starting!

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:10.440
What are we going to do?

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:13.910
I'm exhausted.

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:17.030
Huh? What are you two doing?

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:20.750
Oh, we just... We got the awards wet.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.930
You did what?

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:24.170
Are you okay?

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:25.900
I'll lend you my dryer.

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:26.980
Huh?

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:29.430
I always bring it with me 
to use after P.E. class.

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:32.510
Really? That would be a huge help!

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:36.600
Th-Thanks.

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:38.120
No problem.

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.550
Oh, right.

00:16:39.550 --> 00:16:43.120
I hear you subbed in for 
the absent referee.

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:44.300
Thanks.

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:46.120
There!

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.730
Hey, what are you doing?

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.590
What else is wet?

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:59.200
Huh? Oh... just these.

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:02.200
How many of these did you get wet?

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:04.460
Sorry.

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:20.470
What's wrong?

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:23.230
Nothing.

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:31.260
U-Um... Could you take care of this?

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:31.980
Huh?

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:35.980
Sato-san and I have a 
game we want to go watch.

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:38.490
Our seniors are playing in it.

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:40.240
Sure.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:41.960
We'll do it.

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:45.750
I got to watch my seniors play 
thanks to you, Sato-san.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:50.880
They're still playing, right?

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:51.710
Yeah.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:53.370
It's not over, is it?

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:54.510
No.

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:04.540
We can't get in.

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:07.100
I can't.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:09.560
Time out.

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:15.070
Why is Yuki trying so hard?

00:18:15.590 --> 00:18:16.570
Who knows?

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:21.410
Yukki, I'm surprised you still 
have the energy to attack.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:24.340
I don't have that much energy.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.540
I'm getting tired.

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:29.010
Tournaments are brutal.

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:32.590
I don't have any energy 
left by the final match.

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:36.330
But, the finals are a sparkling stage.

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:38.330
We don't usually have much luck,

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:41.220
so this will make a nice memory.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:46.750
Everything's sparkling so 
much, I can barely see.

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:51.610
Excuse me, but you look like you're about 
to depart our world with that memory.

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:54.220
When your turn to serve comes around,

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:56.280
it's like playing Russian roulette.

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.480
I know.

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:58.930
They say important games like these...

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:01.490
are decided by the first 
person to make a mistake.

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:04.660
H-Hey, don't say that.

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:07.280
I'm about to serve.

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:10.910
Just take it easy, Shun-chan.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:12.180
That's right.

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:15.970
I won't blame you even 
if we're second place.

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:19.240
<i>What if I mess up?</i>

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:21.300
Shun-chan.

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:23.320
You can do it!

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:24.580
Masaki-chan.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:26.310
It's Matsushita-kun.

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:27.980
Hey, Mary.

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:30.650
You've got the best seat in the house.

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:33.730
Oh, right. You can't see if 
you're sitting any lower.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:35.320
Everyone around you would be too tall.

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:37.340
Shut up!

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.360
You! We're in the middle of a match.

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:43.610
If you're not going to serve, 
I'm giving the ball to the other team.

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:45.370
Oh, sorry.

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:47.110
Steady.

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:48.870
Y-You can do it!

00:19:52.810 --> 00:19:54.380
<i>He waved to me.</i>

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:57.630
Why are they stopping the game?

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:04.520
I'm glad we got to watch the game.

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:05.690
Yeah.

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:07.680
Th-They're so cool.

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:09.140
Yeah.

00:20:12.070 --> 00:20:13.390
A-Amazing.

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:14.970
He jumped so high.

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:18.030
I saw it! He jumped! 
He jumped really high!

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.780
He jumped this high.

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.840
No, higher!

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:24.400
Way higher! This high!

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:28.050
Hey, quit playing around 
and cheer for us.

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:30.220
Now, now, Chizuru-san.

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:33.330
Who cares? They seem to be having fun.

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:46.930
Don't bother. You won't make it.

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:52.230
You shouldn't underestimate 
the strength of a man...

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:55.230
who led his team to victory 
at the sports festival.

00:20:55.610 --> 00:20:58.230
I'm not underestimating you, 
and you didn't lead us anywhere.

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:03.020
What? Didn't everyone 
see my glorious plays?

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:07.060
Why don't you get one in, then?

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:10.370
You have one chance. Go ahead.

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:11.710
What?

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:14.380
Why are you setting the bar so high?

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:15.590
You're so mean.

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:17.000
You're the one who set it that high.

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:20.000
Damn it.

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:25.670
<i>Then... Then, if I make this, 
Mary will show up again...</i>

00:21:25.670 --> 00:21:26.800
Sh-Shun-chan.

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:27.880
That was quick!

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:29.260
Masaki-chan.

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:32.020
Are you doing something for the 
Athletics Committee again?

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:35.520
No, today I'm the class officer.

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:37.990
You're by yourself again? 
Isn't that heavy?

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:39.760
I-I'm fine.

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:41.080
Sato-san.

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:44.410
Are you taking that to 
the faculty office?

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:46.280
Do you want me to carry half?

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:49.080
I'm on my way to the office.

00:21:55.970 --> 00:21:59.830
Thanks. Half, then.

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:00.920
Okay.

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:03.710
Be careful.

00:22:03.710 --> 00:22:06.300
Remember, you don't have to carry her.

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:13.520
Anyway... Let's pick up 
where we left off, Chizuru-kun.

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:15.670
Let's see you throw it in.

00:22:15.670 --> 00:22:19.580
Ow, my stomach suddenly hurts.

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:21.060
Shun-chan, you do it for me.

00:22:21.060 --> 00:22:22.910
What? Me?

00:22:22.910 --> 00:22:25.060
One chance, just one chance.

00:22:25.060 --> 00:22:25.940
What?

00:22:25.940 --> 00:22:26.870
You're one to talk.

00:22:26.870 --> 00:22:29.680
I'm sorta nervous.

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:31.280
You are, aren't you?

00:22:31.880 --> 00:22:35.200
<i>It's okay. You can do it, you can do it.</i>

00:24:16.990 --> 00:24:20.880
Stripped Bare

00:24:17.300 --> 00:24:19.400
The next episode is "Stripped Bare."
